  "2325": { "hanzi": "离开故乡多年，他一直深深怀念着亲人。", "pinyin": "Líkāi gùxiāng duō nián, tā yīzhí shēnshēn huáiniàn zhe qīnrén.", "meaning": "Leaving hometown for years, he deeply missed relatives." },
