  "2328": { "hanzi": "黄金价格受到国际金融市场的直接影响。", "pinyin": "Huángjīn jiàgé shòudào guójì jīnróng shìchǎng de zhíjiē yǐngxiǎng.", "meaning": "Gold prices are directly affected by international finance." },
