  "2332": { "hanzi": "课堂讨论气氛非常活跃，同学们踊跃发言。", "pinyin": "Kètáng tǎolùn qìfēn fēicháng huóyuè, tóngxuémen yǒngyuè fāyán.", "meaning": "Class discussion atmosphere was active, students spoke eagerly." },
